title: Start
---
Narrator: Player stands at the starting line of the Scarlet Loop, ready to begin the race of their life.  
Narrator: The sound of engines fills the air as Nova, your rival, gives you a sharp glance.  

Nova: "You sure you’re ready for this, Kane?"  
    -> "I was born ready, Nova." 
        <<jump Node2A>>
    -> "We'll see who crosses the finish line first." 
        <<jump Node2B>>
===
title: Node2A
---
Narrator: You respond with confidence, gripping the wheel tighter as the countdown begins.  
    -> "Push for an early lead." 
        <<jump Node3>>
    -> "Wait for the perfect moment to strike." 
        <<jump Node3>>
