title: Node3
---
Narrator: The race begins, and the Scarlet Loop lives up to its name with neon lights flashing past.  
Narrator: The track splits ahead!  
    -> "Take the shortcut on the left." 
        <<jump Node4A>>
    -> "Stick to the main track." 
        <<jump Node4B>>
===
title: Node4A
---
Narrator: The shortcut narrows dangerously, but you hold your nerve.  
Nova: "You really think that’s going to work, Kane?"  
    -> "Ignore her and focus on the track." 
        <<jump Node5>>
    -> "Respond with a taunt." 
        <<jump Node5>>
