        <<jump EndingB>>
===
title: EndingA
---
Narrator: You hit the nitro boost, surging ahead of Nova to cross the finish line first.  
Narrator: Victory is yours, but your reckless move damages your racer. Nova glares at you, already plotting her revenge.  
    -> Continue
        <<jump Start>>
